sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as ML Training Code<br/>(Python SDK)
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant OTel as OTel-instrumented<br/>Service
    participant Pod as ML Workload Pod
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>5000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LLM as LLM Provider<br/>(OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SDK,S3: Flow 1: Experiment Tracking
    SDK->>MLflow: POST /api/2.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (K8s SA)<br/>HTTP 5000/TCP, Optional TLS
    MLflow->>PG: INSERT experiment/run metadata<br/>PostgreSQL wire protocol<br/>5432/TCP, Optional TLS, Password auth
    MLflow->>S3: PUT artifact (model, dataset)<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / Access Key
    S3-->>MLflow: 200 OK
    MLflow-->>SDK: Run ID + artifact URI

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: AI Gateway Inference
    Client->>MLflow: POST /gateway/{endpoint}/mlflow/invocations<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>HTTP 5000/TCP, Optional TLS
    MLflow->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer Token)
    LLM-->>MLflow: Chat completion response (JSON/SSE)
    MLflow-->>Client: Proxied response<br/>HTTP/SSE, Optional TLS

    Note over OTel,PG: Flow 3: OpenTelemetry Trace Ingestion
    OTel->>MLflow: POST /v1/traces<br/>Auth: Bearer Token + X-MLflow-Experiment-ID<br/>HTTP 5000/TCP, Optional TLS
    MLflow->>PG: INSERT trace spans<br/>PostgreSQL 5432/TCP<br/>Optional TLS, Password auth
    MLflow-->>OTel: 200 OK

    Note over Pod,K8sAPI: Flow 4: Kubernetes Workspace Authentication
    Pod->>MLflow: GET /api/2.0/mlflow/experiments/list<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA) + X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE<br/>HTTP 5000/TCP, Optional TLS
    MLflow->>K8sAPI: GET /api/v1/namespaces/{ns}<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Service Account Token
    K8sAPI-->>MLflow: Namespace info (workspace mapping)
    MLflow->>PG: SELECT experiments WHERE workspace = {ws}<br/>5432/TCP
    PG-->>MLflow: Filtered experiment list
    MLflow-->>Pod: Workspace-scoped experiments
